  <Intro>k__BackingField: Three covens hid from the purge in three dead towns of the wastes, and each thinks it is the last. Bring them under one banner before the Holy Order finds them one by one.
  <Outro>k__BackingField: Three covens, one banner. The Order's spies ride home with news nobody there will believe.
  <Goal>k__BackingField: Hold three towns at once.
  <Loss>k__BackingField: Win by day 70, when the crusade sets out.
